Subject: [FWD 7.2.9] mm: re-install migrated write-fenced folios read-only

Fwd-port of upstream ("mm/migrate: re-install migrated write-fenced
folios read-only", Gregory Price, series position 085) onto Linux
7.2.9.

Why needed: 7.2.9 carries the uffd-wp API evolution
(pte_swp_uffd_wp/pte_mkuffd_wp, pmd_swp_uffd_wp/pmd_mkuffd_wp) plus
extra young/dirty preservation lines that the branch base lacks, so
the mkwrite-site hunks are refreshed to the _wp forms with identical
helper wiring (migration_remap_rmap_flags/migration_remap_writable).
Redundant anon-exclusive blocks removed as upstream. internal.h
helpers verbatim upstream.

Byte-identical upstream patch retained in series/ (recorded SKIP-FWD).
Verifies with git apply --check (no fuzz).

Signed-off-by: Saphira builder <builder@saphira.vm2.uk>
---
